  "description": "Hee-joo, an art therapist, will consult with killer Su-hyun, who believes he is a terrible monster. Once a week, during 10 consultations,  \nWhat did he find in his painting? Can Su-hyun heal, why was the monster made, and who was the monster?\n\nThe remaining time until the statute of limitations on the murder of the mother of art therapist Hee-joo is 10 weeks.  \nAnd Su-hyun, a time-limited patient who believes that she is a terrible monster who visited Hee-ju.  \nThe two begin a 10-week art therapy.\n\nThe story of art therapy counseling between Hee-joo, an art therapist who wants to make him live, and Su-hyun, a killer who does not want to live.\n\n[Original Novel](https://series.naver.com/novel/detail.series?productNo=9318396)  \n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=5582369)",
